ite the DELIVERY documentation.While the full mypy gate runs, let me write the DELIVERY.md documentation:Full mypy passes — no issues in 331 files. Let me capture the test evidence into artifacts and write DELIVERY.md:Now let me verify the final deliverable state — check exactly which files were added in the isolated workspace:The `M` entries are the pre-existing dirty baseline. Let me confirm my additions are exactly the intended new files:Let me verify DELIVERY.md is visible to git and confirm my two source files are new (untracked):All three deliverable files are new untracked additions inside my isolated workspace; the `M` entries are the pre-existing dirty baseline I never touched. Let me do a final review of the complete module to confirm coherence:Everything is verified and coherent. Let me finalize the todo list:U02-DISPOSITION 任务完成。全部工作在指定隔离目录 `.coordination/20261014/workspaces/u02-disposition` 内，未触碰另一个 U02 目录、用户保留任务或任何既有文件。\n\n## 交付内容（仅新增）\n\n- `zscope/config/acceptance_feedback.py` — 按 `zscope.acceptance-dispositions.v1` 合同实现的独立持久处置存储 + 服务层 GET/POST 接线边界\n- `tests/test_acceptance_feedback.py` — 24 个定向测试\n- `DELIVERY.md` + `artifacts/quality-gates.txt` — 交付说明与测试证据\n\n## 设计要点\n\n**身份绑定（服务器派生）**：Store 只接受后台派生的 `IssueScope`（report_id、issue_id、build_context_id、issue_digest、object_digest 五元组合成 scope_key）；客户端 digest/路径一律不可信。报告/问题/构建/对象任一摘要变化落入全新身份链，旧处置永不复用；未知构建（null）只匹配未知构建，不是通配。身份与摘要全部复用现有规范函数（`issue_identity`、`context_revision`、`issue_build_context_id`、`issue_resource_signature`、`findings_for_view`），未建第二份 validation 库。\n\n**持久化与并发**：独立 SQLite 库，`BEGIN IMMEDIATE` 原子事务；每身份链单调 revision + 乐观 `base_revision` CAS；`request_id` 台账保证幂等重发（同 id 同载荷返回首次结果）并拒绝同 id 不同请求（409）；失败 rollback 保留旧记录。`clear` 保留完整历史；`risk_accept` 支持带时区 `expires_at`，过期后自动失效、不隐藏 pending。\n\n**四种处置边界**：duplicate 目标经服务器校验（当前报告、真实、不同、严格同构建），不合并根因/对象；followup 仅本地待办记录；全程不写 validation verdict、业务回答、baseline、suppression、Review Memory（有字节级不变证明）。\n\n## 验证结果（WSL Linux，Python 3.13.15，均在私有 tmp_path）\n\n- `pytest -